  "description": "The Roadmachine 01 THREE is an all-road bike engineered to excel on wherever you ride. This model is built on our ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame – the pinnacle of BMC layup technology – engineered to deliver immediate responsiveness, refined compliance, and an impressively low weight.\nEngineered for all-day tarmac and confident all-road detours, the frame’s intelligent compliance and generous tire clearance give you freedom on the route and comfort in the saddle. Shimano Ultegra Di2 takes care of fast, reliable shifting, paired with an integrated power meter for precision pacing and training.\nUp front, our ICS2 stem and carbon bars give you an adaptable fit, intuitive control, and clean integration. CE40 Carbon tubeless-ready wheels keep things fast, light, and smooth across changing surfaces. Then there’s a rear light and integrated storage, too.\nA dependable all-road bike with all the makings of a race machine, this is the Roadmachine 01 THREE.",
